prompt:
Create an original 1536×1024 true-transparent RGBA sprite sheet for JAMVERSE '96. Use the supplied Leo gameplay sprite only as the identity and pixel-art style reference. Draw exactly six distinct complete full-body Leo poses in a strict three-column by two-row grid, row-major, broad transparent gutters and outer margins. Each pose is fully inside its own cell at a consistent scale and camera, with long hair, hands and shoes visible. Use readable 1990s arcade pixel-art clusters and dark outlines.

Leo is the pale aristocratic adult man and captain of the Blackthorn Court Kings. Preserve natural adult human anatomy, pale skin, long wavy black hair, refined mustache, composed handsome face and patient master-strategist poise. He wears the controlled black basketball uniform with restrained crimson accents, matching shorts and shoes, and refined trim. Exactly two human arms, two hands, two legs and two shoes. No fangs, horns, cape, robe, monster traits, extra limbs, costume change, or props.

This is a right-facing behind-the-back pass to a teammate off-screen on image-left. The basketball is separate runtime art. Both hands remain empty; do not draw any ball, sphere, orb, seams, court, hoop, rim, floor, shadow, background, glow, border, grid, text, teammate or opponent. All exterior and gutters must be real alpha-zero transparency, without checkerboard, matte, speckles or haze.

Six sequential, connected, distinct poses:
0 poised ready stance facing image-right, elbows bent and hands empty at the chest;
1 gathers the invisible ball at the waist and shifts weight toward the lead foot;
2 pivots the shoulders slightly away from the target, carrying the ball-miming hand behind the lower back;
3 RELEASE at simulation tick5: one empty hand snaps behind Leo’s hip toward image-left, fingers open; the other arm balances in front; keep the motion readable without hiding Leo’s face or hair;
4 follows through behind the body with an open hand and controlled step;
5 returns to a composed balanced right-facing stance, both hands empty.

The deceptive pass should read clearly without twisting anatomy or changing the overall right-facing action. Maintain Leo’s pale human face, long wavy black hair, refined mustache, black/crimson uniform, adult proportions and complete shoes. Return only the transparent sprite sheet.
